  "question_count": 1,
  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "For the delay compensation, is the 20 yuan (products I and II) / 10 yuan (product III) charged per unit for each quarter that a unit of demand remains undelivered (i.e., if a unit is short in Q1 and finally delivered in Q3, it incurs 2 quarters of delay compensation), or is it a one-time penalty of that amount per unit whenever any shortage occurs in a quarter?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy choice between two mutually exclusive calculation methods for delay compensation."
}

